,{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"そう言えば、この近くに廃病院があるわよ。チェルノボーグの地区病院。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"どこにあるか、教えてあげましょうか？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"たくましい子供","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弱々しい子供","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"ルブレフ君……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"たくましい子供","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"無視しろ、俺たちを騙そうとしてるんだ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"たくましい子供","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……あいつを撒こう。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"たくましい子供","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"あの街道が見えるか？　そこの角から走っていって、一分以内に逃げ込むぞ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弱々しい子供","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……わかった。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"たくましい子供","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"――よし、走れ！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_9"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"へえ、なかなか速いじゃない。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"たくましい子供","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"あ、あいつはなんでこんな早く追いついて来るんだ――うっ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弱々しい子供","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"ルブレフ君……足が！　血、血が黒くなってる……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"たくましい子供","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"クソッ、お前を助けてなけりゃ、あんな奴簡単に撒けるのに……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弱々しい子供","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"ごめんね、ごめんね……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"たくましい子供","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"もういい！　静かにしろ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"たくましい子供","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"隠れるぞ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"この先の道を左に曲がると、廃墟になった広場があるわ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"広場の西側に見える、一番大きな白い建物が病院よ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"打ち捨てられた病院。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弱々しい子供","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……僕たち、見つかってるみたい……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"たくましい子供","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"お前が言うこと聞かないからだろ――もういいよ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"たくましい子供","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"おい、魔族。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"たくましい子供","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……なんで俺たちにそんなこと教えるんだ？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"ただの気まぐれよ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"あんたたち、どんな関係？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弱々しい子供","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"たくましい子供","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……食べ物を探してたら、こいつを見つけたんだ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弱々しい子供","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"ルブレフ君は、僕を助けてくれた……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"へぇ……だからその子の言うことを聞いてるの？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弱々しい子供","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"そしたら今度は、あんたが恩人を助ける番じゃない？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"たくましい子供","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"こいつに何をさせるつもりだ？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弱々しい子供","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"ルブレフ君……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"別に何もさせないわよ。ただ、この先のそう遠くないところに病院があるなあっていうだけで。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"レユニオンは医療物資をただ放置しておくほど馬鹿じゃないわ。だから、もしあんたがそのルブレフ君を助けたいなら……奪うしかない。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"あそこは暴徒と化した