の医療物資は、地下倉庫にあるわ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"駐車場の通気口から忍び込んでもいいし、科学廃棄物だらけになってなければ、排水溝を進んでもいい。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"もしかしたら、死んじゃうかもしれないけどね。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弱々しい子供","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"たくましい子供","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"ほら、足が震えてるじゃないか！　やめとけ！　こんな魔族の言うことなんて聞かないほうがいいんだ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"たくましい子供","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"さっさと行くぞ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弱々しい子供","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"待ってよ、ルブレフ君！　僕は……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弱々しい子供","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"うわっ――"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"たくましい子供","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"な、何だ？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"龍門で色々あったから……ここにも影響が出てるのね。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"天災が起きて、怪我人が溢れて……今のチェルノボーグでは医療物資は貴重よ。みんな放っておくわけはないわ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"魔族のあたしが、ここの病院についてこんなに詳しいのは……どうしてだと思う？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"たくましい子供","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"この――うっ、ああ――"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弱々しい子供","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"僕は……僕は……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"――あの子、苦しそうね。このままの勢いで悪化すれば、いずれ薬も効かなくなる。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"もしあんたが今、決断しないんだったら……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"二人とも、ここで死ねばいいわ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弱々しい子供","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"ああ……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"たくましい子供","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"おい、お、お前、何するつもりだ！　近づくな！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"行くの？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"行かないの？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"ああ……でも今から行っても遅いかもね。もう暴動が起こってるみたいだし、盗み出すのもきっとかなり難しくなった――"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弱々しい子供","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"で、でも……ぼ、僕は行くよ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"――へぇ……死ぬわよ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"たくましい子供","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"な、なんでそいつの言うことを聞くんだ、せっかく俺が助けてやったのに！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弱々しい子供","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"で、でも……僕は、やってみたいんだ……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"たくましい子供","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"そんなこと……お前にできるわけないだろ！　大丈夫、このまま薬局と食べ物を探して歩いてれば、きっとどうにかなる！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弱々しい子供","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"でも――"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弱々しい子供","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"ごめん……ごめんね！　ルブレフ君！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"たくましい子供","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"おい……おい！　待てよ！　行くな！　おい！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"あの子の名前すら知らないあんたが、止められるわけないのよ。可哀想に。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"たくましい子供","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"お前……あいつを騙したな！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"騙す？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"嘘は一つも言ってないわ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"もちろん、信じる信じないはあんた次第だけど。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"あの子を信じるかどうかも、あんた次第よ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"たくましい子供","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……クソッ、俺が、あいつを止めに行く、うぐ……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"どうして？　あの子を信じられないの？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"たくましい子供","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"あ、あいつは、俺がいなきゃ何にもできないんだ……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"あの子が逃げないか心配してるのね。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"あんたはこう考えてるんでしょ……あいつはどうして俺をこんな魔族のところに残していったんだ、俺が殺されてもいいのかって。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"たくましい子供","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"デタラメ言うな！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"たくましい子供","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"*ウルサススラング*！　この化物め――"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"――黙って。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"……ここで一歩も動かず、あの子を待ちなさい。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"そうじゃなきゃ、今すぐにでも殺すわよ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"たくましい子供","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"うう――"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"あんたは知らないだろうけど……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"あたしは殺人鬼よ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"この街を破壊し、あんたの両親や友達を傷つけた殺人鬼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"……ああ、アハハ、そうだ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"あんたはまだその刀を持ってるんだったわね。その血に染まった柄の装飾は、サルカズのものよ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"血は、誰のだと思う？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"たくましい子供","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"う……うう、し、知らない……お前はあいつを……クソッ、こっち見るな！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"……泣けばいいわ。子供は泣くものだから。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"これからの生死は……あんたたち次第だけどね。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"たくましい子供","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"あいつには無理だ……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"そうかしら？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"たくましい子供","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"だって、俺が瓦礫の下から掘り出さなかったら、あいつはとっくに……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"たくましい子供","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……だからあいつは、俺なしじゃダメなんだ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"誰にも……その人がいないとダメなんて相手はいないのよ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"そう、誰にもね。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"たくましい子供","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"静かになってきたわね。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"あの大虐殺以来、抵抗する奴は減ったわ。いい傾向ねぇ。楽ができるし、死人も減る。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"病院の方も静かになった。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"たくましい子供","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"たくましい子供","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"あいつは……もしかしたら……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"たくましい子供","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"あいつはもしかしたら……行ってないかも……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"たくましい子供","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"もうこんなに……うう、時間が経ったのに……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"そうね、逃げたのかもね。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"たくましい子供","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"だけど、あんたがあの子を助けたんだから、あの子もあんたのために頑張るはずでしょう？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"たくましい子供","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……俺は……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"それとも、あんたはあの子を救えるけど、あの子はあんたを救えないと思ってるの？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"たくましい子供","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"あいつは……ずっと何をさせてもダメだったんだ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"たくましい子供","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"食べ物を探しに行ったときもそうだ！　あいつは店の中に人がいることにも気づかなかった！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"たくましい子供","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"あいつのせいだ！　あいつのせいで俺の足が――"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"たくましい子供","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"どこに行くつもり？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"たくましい子供","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……一人で帰る。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"言ったでしょ、ここを離れたら死ぬって。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"たくましい子供","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"でもあいつは逃げたんだ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"へぇ――"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"その目……あんた、あの子を恨んでるのね。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"たくましい子供","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"ち、違う！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"たくましい子供","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"だって、もし……本当に行ってても……こんなに時間が経ってる……きっともう……あいつは……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"――黙りなさい。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"あの子が戻るまで、あんたに本当のことはわからない。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"あの子が帰って来るって思っててもいいし、帰ってこないって思っててもいいわ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"だけどあの子じゃ無理だなんて思ったり、恨んだりするのは、あんた自身に問題があるわ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"……あんたはどうして、あの子が失敗するか、逃げるに違いないって決めつけてるの？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"あんたがあの子を助けたから？　あんたの方が上だから？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"たくましい子供","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……うう。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"たくましい子供","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"うわああ――"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"まだ泣く元気があるのね。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"安心して、すぐに痛みで泣く余裕すらなくなるわ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"あんたはまだ小さいしサルカズでもないから、ホントに耐えられなくなったらあたしに言って。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"楽にしてあげるから。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"たくましい子供","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"う……ううん……うう……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"意識が混濁してきたわね。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"あーあ……間に合わないかぁ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"たくましい子供","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"やめろ……俺はまだ……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"たくましい子供","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"あいつを……待……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"死ぬのが怖いから、あの子を信じることにしたの？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRe